Branding patches
----------------

The grafted notetux files reference "Notetux++" in window titles and
"~/.config/notetux" for user config directories. We rebranded these in our
fork via `src/branding.h` (single source of truth) plus minimal edits to:

  src/editor.c       — APP_NAME in window title strings (lines ~314, ~316)
  src/stylestore.c   — APP_CONFIG_DIR for user stylers.xml (lines ~352–357, ~385)
  src/udl.c          — APP_CONFIG_DIR for user UDL directory (line ~491)

When Andrea Coi merges this codebase upstream, flipping `branding.h` reverts
to "Notetux++" / "notetux" with no other changes needed.

Vendored libraries (symlinked from the macOS port at ../notepad-plus-plus-macos/):

